X-WR-CALNAME:Upcoming AI shutdowns | Killed by AI
X-WR-CALDESC:Confirmed shutdown and deprecation dates for AI products and
  models. Source: killedbyai.net/coming-soon/
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:P1D
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gemini-flash-pro-for-free-users@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261010
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Gemini Flash & Pro for Free Users
DESCRIPTION:From October 9\, people using the Gemini app on a personal ac
 count without a Google AI plan lose the Flash and Pro models and are lef
 t with Flash-Lite. AI Plus subscribers keep Flash but lose Pro\, on a da
 te Google emails them individually. It is the second free-tier squeeze i
 n five months\, after the May 2026 switch to compute-based usage limits.
  Replacement: Gemini Flash-Lite\; Google AI Plus for Flash\, or AI Pro /
  Ultra for Pro. Source: https://support.google.com/gemini/answer/1700413
 6
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#gemini-flash-pro-for-free-users
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:azure-openai-gpt-4-1-nano@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261015
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Azure OpenAI GPT-4.1 nano
DESCRIPTION:GPT-4.1 nano\, the smallest of the April 2025 GPT-4.1 family\
 , retires on Azure OpenAI on October 14\, 2026\, 18 months after launch\
 , with no replacement listed. Its siblings got a reprieve: Microsoft pus
 hed gpt-4.1 and gpt-4.1-mini back to April 14\, 2027. Nano's own date ha
 s flipped back and forth in Microsoft's docs since August\; as of the Se
 ptember 23 update it is October 14 again. Fine-tuned nano deployments ke
 ep running until October 14\, 2027. Replacement: None listed. Source: ht
 tps://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-reti
 rement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#azure-openai-gpt-4-1-nano
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gpt-5-5-in-chatgpt-codex@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261015
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: GPT-5.5 in ChatGPT & Codex
DESCRIPTION:OpenAI's April 23 flagship leaves ChatGPT\, ChatGPT Work and 
 Codex on every plan on October 14\, 174 days after launch. Codex users o
 n paid plans are pointed to GPT-6 Sol and Free and Go users to GPT-6 Lun
 a\, both 'when available'. The API keeps gpt-5.5\, and Azure lists it un
 til October 26\, 2027\, so the model outlives its own chat app by a year
 . Replacement: GPT-6 Sol (paid plans) / GPT-6 Luna (Free & Go)\, when av
 ailable. Source: https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/models
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#gpt-5-5-in-chatgpt-codex
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:claude-sonnet-4-on-amazon-bedrock@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261015
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Claude Sonnet 4 on Amazon Bedrock
DESCRIPTION:Anthropic retired claude-sonnet-4-20250514 from its own API o
 n June 15\, but Bedrock kept serving it for another 121 days. AWS marked
  it Legacy on April 14: new customers were locked out\, and existing one
 s could lose access after 15 days of inactivity. On July 14 it moved int
 o 'public extended access'\, where AWS tells customers to expect higher 
 prices set by the provider. End of life is October 14 in all 23 regions 
 listed. Replacement: None named by AWS (Anthropic recommends claude-sonn
 et-4-6). Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/userguide/mo
 del-lifecycle-legacy.html
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#claude-sonnet-4-on-amazon-bedrock
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sora-2-on-azure-openai-foundry@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261015
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261016
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Sora 2 on Azure OpenAI / Foundry
DESCRIPTION:Sora outlives its maker's own shutdown by three weeks: OpenAI
  switched its Sora API off on September 24\, but Microsoft pushed the Az
 ure retirement from September 15 to October 15\, with no replacement. Un
 til then\, the last place to generate a Sora video is a Microsoft data c
 entre. Replacement: None listed. Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-
 us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-retirement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#sora-2-on-azure-openai-foundry
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gemini-2-5-pro-flash-flash-lite-vertex-ai@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261020
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261021
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Gemini 2.5 Pro / Flash / Flash Lite (Vertex AI)
DESCRIPTION:Google retires the Gemini 2.5 family on Vertex AI (now the Ge
 mini Enterprise Agent Platform) on October 20\, 2026\, four days after t
 he October 16 date it previously gave. That date blocks new projects and
  any project that hasn't called the model since July 22\; per a re-issue
 d September 15 customer notice quoted publicly\, existing workloads keep
  running until January 28\, 2027 for Flash-Lite and March 31\, 2027 for 
 Flash and Pro (August 6\, 2027 in the KR\, BR and FR regions). On the Ge
 mini Developer API the models are still 'not deprecated'\, but since Sep
 tember 18 only projects that used them before can call them. Replacement
 : gemini-3.8-flash / gemini-3.5-flash / gemini-3.5-flash-lite / gemini-3
 .1-flash-lite. Source: https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-a
 gent-platform/models/model-versions
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#gemini-2-5-pro-flash-flash-lite-v
 ertex-ai
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:vertex-ai-open-model-maas-16-models@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261022
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Vertex AI Open-Model MaaS (16 models)
DESCRIPTION:Google Cloud drops managed serving for 16 open models on Octo
 ber 21: four DeepSeek endpoints (V3.1\, V3.2\, R1-0528 and DeepSeek-OCR)
 \, GLM-5 and 4.7\, gpt-oss-20b\, Kimi K2 Thinking\, Llama 3.3 70B\, Mini
 Max M2\, two e5 embedding models and four Qwen3 variants. You can still 
 run them\; you just have to host them yourself. Replacement: Self-deploy
  the weights from Model Garden. Source: https://docs.cloud.google.com/ge
 mini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/deprecations/open-models
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#vertex-ai-open-model-maas-16-mode
 ls
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gemini-omni-flash-preview-veo-3-1-previews@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261022
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261023
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Gemini Omni Flash Preview & Veo 3.1 Previews
DESCRIPTION:Google's text-and-image-to-video preview launched June 30\, 2
 026. When gemini-omni-1.1-flash went GA on August 27\, Google said the p
 review endpoint would be 'deprecated on September 30\, 2026'\; the depre
 cations table sets the actual shutdown for no earlier than October 22\, 
 which would make a 114-day life. The three Veo 3.1 previews (veo-3.1-gen
 erate-preview\, veo-3.1-fast-generate-preview and veo-3.1-lite-generate-
 preview) go the same day\, to the same replacement. Replacement: gemini-
 omni-1.1-flash. Source: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/deprecatio
 ns
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#gemini-omni-flash-preview-veo-3-1
 -previews
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-gpt-4-gpt-4-turbo-gpt-3-5-turbo-o1-o3-mini-o4-mini@killedbyai.
 net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261024
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: OpenAI GPT-4\, GPT-4 Turbo\, GPT-3.5 Turbo\, o1\, 
 o3-mini & o4-mini
DESCRIPTION:One date kills three eras. On October 23\, OpenAI removes gpt
 -3.5-turbo (the engine that launched ChatGPT)\, gpt-4\, gpt-4-0613\, gpt
 -4-turbo and gpt-4-1106-preview (the models that defined 2023)\, and mos
 t of its first generation of reasoning models (o1\, o1-pro\, o3-mini\, o
 4-mini)\, plus gpt-4o-2024-05-13\, gpt-4.1-nano and gpt-image-1. o3 and 
 o3-pro follow on December 11. Every fine-tune built on them dies the sam
 e day. Seventeen table rows\, six months' notice. Replacement: gpt-5.6-s
 ol / gpt-5.6-terra / gpt-5.6-luna / gpt-image-2.5-sunburst or -flare. So
 urce: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-gpt-4-gpt-4-turbo-gpt-3-5-
 turbo-o1-o3-mini-o4-mini
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:xai-grok-imagine-image-quality@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261103
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: xAI Grok Imagine Image Quality
DESCRIPTION:xAI retires the grok-imagine-image-quality slug on November 2
 \, after 60 days' notice. Calls will not fail. They are redirected to gr
 ok-imagine-image-2.0 at the 'low' quality setting\, $0.01 per image chea
 per\, and only the model field in the response shows the change. grok-im
 agine-image-pro was already redirected to the 'quality' model in May and
  now gets forwarded a second time. Replacement: grok-imagine-image-2.0. 
 Source: https://docs.x.ai/developers/migration/imagine-image-quality-nov
 -2
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#xai-grok-imagine-image-quality
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-models-in-cursor@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: OpenAI Models in Cursor
DESCRIPTION:OpenAI is ending its contract to supply models to the AI code
  editor Cursor on November 12\, 2026\, using a change-of-ownership claus
 e after SpaceX completed its $60B purchase of Cursor in August. 'It boil
 s down to trust\,' said OpenAI's Thibault Sottiaux\, citing Elon Musk's 
 history of breaking contracts. Built-in GPT access ends\, but developers
  can still bring their own OpenAI API keys or use OpenAI's IDE extension
 \, and Cursor says OpenAI models were only about 5% of its traffic. Curs
 or says it is 'speaking with the OpenAI team to resolve this.' Replaceme
 nt: Bring-your-own OpenAI API key or OpenAI's IDE extension\; Claude and
  other models in Cursor. Source: https://openai.com/index/our-decision-o
 n-cursor-following-its-acquisition-by-spacex/
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-models-in-cursor
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:reddit-rss-feeds-public-api@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261114
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Reddit RSS Feeds & Public API
DESCRIPTION:Killed by AI in the literal sense. Reddit turns off RSS on No
 vember 13\, saying 'RSS has now become a common surface for large-scale 
 scraping and automated abuse'. It also stops new public API requests on 
 October 31 and closes the remaining public endpoints in March 2027. The 
 data now goes to paying AI licensees instead\; that revenue line grew 24
 % last quarter. Replacement: None for outside readers\; registered apps 
 only (deadline Jan 12\, 2027). Source: https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/30
 /reddit-is-killing-rss-feeds-ending-public-api-access-because-of-ai-bots
 /
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#reddit-rss-feeds-public-api
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:google-opal-gemini-gems@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Google Opal & Gemini Gems
DESCRIPTION:Google switches off Opal\, its Labs no-code builder for AI mi
 ni-apps launched in July 2025\, on November 17. The 'Gems made by Labs' 
 it powered go the same day\, and neither migrates anywhere. Ordinary Gem
 s\, the custom chatbots Google shipped in 2024\, are being converted int
 o Gemini Skills: personal accounts from November\, Workspace business in
  March 2027 and education in June 2027. Opal workflow files stay in Goog
 le Drive as plain text\; they just stop running. Replacement: Gemini Ski
 lls / Google AI Studio. Source: https://developers.google.com/opal/faq
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#google-opal-gemini-gems
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gemini-live-tts-preview-models@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261117
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261118
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Gemini Live & TTS Preview Models
DESCRIPTION:Five voice previews leave the Gemini API no earlier than Nove
 mber 17. Two are Live API models\, gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview and gem
 ini-2.5-flash-native-audio-preview-12-2025. The other three are text-to-
 speech models: gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview\, gemini-2.5-flash-preview-t
 ts and gemini-2.5-pro-preview-tts. The 2.5 TTS models spent 18 months in
  preview and never left it\; the 3.1 Live preview\, released in March\, 
 gets eight. The replacements\, gemini-3.8-live and gemini-3.8-flash-tts\
 , went GA on September 15 and 22. Replacement: gemini-3.8-live / gemini-
 3.8-flash-tts / gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts. Source: https://ai.google.dev
 /gemini-api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#gemini-live-tts-preview-models
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:azure-openai-o-series-o1-o3-o4-mini-o3-pro@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Azure OpenAI o-series (o1\, o3\, o4-mini\, o3-pro)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft folded its staggered schedule into one date: o1\, o
 1-pro\, o3\, o3-deep-research\, o3-mini\, o3-pro and o4-mini all retire 
 November 19\, 2026. That pushed o3-mini back from October 1\, o4-mini fr
 om October 16 and o1\, o1-pro and o3 from October 21\, and pulled o3-pro
  forward from December 17. gpt-5.6-sol is the recommended replacement\, 
 or gpt-5.6-terra for o3-mini and o4-mini\; codex-mini goes four days ear
 lier with none. Azure now keeps o1 and the minis about four weeks longer
  than OpenAI's own API\, and kills o3 and o3-pro about three weeks soone
 r. Replacement: gpt-5.6-sol / gpt-5.6-terra (o3-mini\, o4-mini). Source:
  https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-r
 etirement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#azure-openai-o-series-o1-o3-o4-mi
 ni-o3-pro
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gemini-3-6-flash-3-7-flash-vertex-ai@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Gemini 3.6 Flash & 3.7 Flash (Vertex AI)
DESCRIPTION:This is what Google's 'short-term availability' GA tier means
  in practice. Gemini 3.6 Flash retires from Vertex AI on November 19\, 1
 21 days after its July 21 release\, and 3.7 Flash follows on January 28\
 , 2027\, 168 days after release. Both are replaced by gemini-3.8-flash. 
 Google never dated the notice\; the dates appeared in its model-versions
  table. GitHub Copilot had already dropped 3.6 Flash on October 2. Repla
 cement: gemini-3.8-flash. Source: https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-e
 nterprise-agent-platform/models/model-versions
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#gemini-3-6-flash-3-7-flash-vertex
 -ai
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:vertex-ai-extensions@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Vertex AI Extensions
DESCRIPTION:Google's managed tool-calling framework for Gemini\, deprecat
 ed with the standard six-month window and switched off after November 26
 \, 2026. The replacement is the Agent Platform\, the third name for this
  idea in as many years. Replacement: Agent Platform. Source: https://doc
 s.cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/extensions/overview
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#vertex-ai-extensions
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ai21-jamba-1-5-large-mini-on-amazon-bedrock@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: AI21 Jamba 1.5 Large & Mini on Amazon Bedrock
DESCRIPTION:AWS moved ai21.jamba-1-5-large-v1:0 and ai21.jamba-1-5-mini-v
 1:0 to Legacy on May 26\, 2026\, which cut off new customers. Both enter
 ed paid public extended access on August 26 and reach end of life in us-
 east-1\, their only listed region\, on November 26. AWS names no replace
 ment. Google Cloud already shut both Jamba 1.5 models down on February 2
 7\, 2026\, and TwelveLabs' Marengo Embed 2.7 leaves Bedrock four days af
 ter them\, on November 30. Replacement: None named. Source: https://docs
 .aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/userguide/model-lifecycle-legacy.html
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#ai21-jamba-1-5-large-mini-on-amaz
 on-bedrock
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:claude-sonnet-4-5@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261130
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Claude Sonnet 4.5
DESCRIPTION:Anthropic's September 2025 coding model\, billed at launch as
  the best in the world for agents and computer use\, retires from the Cl
 aude API on November 30. Anthropic announced the retirement on the model
 's first birthday. Opus 4.5 is next in line: 'not sooner than November 2
 4\, 2026.' Replacement: claude-sonnet-5-5. Source: https://platform.clau
 de.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#claude-sonnet-4-5
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-agent-builder-evals-reusable-prompts@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261130
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: OpenAI Agent Builder\, Evals & Reusable Prompts
DESCRIPTION:The visual agent canvas OpenAI introduced at DevDay 2025 as t
 he centrepiece of AgentKit dies on November 30\, along with the Evals pl
 atform and the /v1/prompts API. Evals goes read-only on October 31. Agen
 t Builder lasted eight months in beta before its death was announced. Re
 placement: Agents SDK\; Workspace Agents in ChatGPT\; prompts in your ow
 n code\; Promptfoo for evals. Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/
 docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-agent-builder-evals-reusab
 le-prompts
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-legacy-gpt-image-models@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: OpenAI Legacy GPT Image Models
DESCRIPTION:OpenAI removes gpt-image-1-mini\, gpt-image-1.5 and chatgpt-i
 mage-latest from the API on December 1\, 2026\, months after this genera
 tion replaced DALL·E. gpt-image-1.5 only shipped on December 16\, 2025\
 , so it gets about 350 days. The models that buried DALL·E don't outliv
 e it by much. Replacement: gpt-image-2.5-sunburst / gpt-image-2.5-flare.
  Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-legacy-gpt-image-models
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:azure-openai-gpt-4o-2024-05-13@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261209
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261210
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Azure OpenAI GPT-4o (2024-05-13)
DESCRIPTION:The original May 2024 GPT-4o snapshot retires from Azure on D
 ecember 9\, and Microsoft uses it as the worked example in its lifecycle
  docs. Global Standard\, Data Zone Standard and Standard deployments are
  force-upgraded to gpt-5.6-sol. Provisioned deployments get no upgrade a
 nd must migrate by hand\, and deployments set to NoAutoUpgrade start ret
 urning 410 Gone. It outlives OpenAI's own gpt-4o-2024-05-13\, which goes
  on October 23\, by seven weeks. The later 2024-08-06 and 2024-11-20 ver
 sions last until April 14\, 2027. Replacement: gpt-5.6-sol (auto-upgrade
  on Standard deployments\; Provisioned must migrate manually). Source: h
 ttps://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-ret
 irement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#azure-openai-gpt-4o-2024-05-13
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-gpt-5-original-snapshots-o3-o3-pro@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: OpenAI GPT-5 (original snapshots)\, o3 & o3-pro
DESCRIPTION:The original GPT-5 launch snapshots (gpt-5-2025-08-07 and its
  mini\, nano and pro siblings) shut down December 11\, along with o3 and
  o3-pro. GPT-5 launched in August 2025 as the 'PhD-level expert' model. 
 Its launch snapshot gets 16 months before it starts returning errors. Re
 placement: gpt-5.6-sol / gpt-5.6-terra / gpt-5.6-luna. Source: https://d
 evelopers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-gpt-5-original-snapshots-o
 3-o3-pro
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:chatgpt-custom-gpts@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: ChatGPT Custom GPTs
DESCRIPTION:Custom GPTs launched at DevDay in November 2023 and replaced 
 ChatGPT Plugins. Now they are being replaced by plugins. OpenAI says the
 y retire on December 11\, 2026\, though timing 'can vary by account and 
 workspace'. Affected Enterprise workspaces lose GPT creation on October 
 26\, and approved deferrals run to February 11\, 2027. Instructions beco
 me a skill and knowledge files carry over\; conversations\, the chosen m
 odel\, sharing settings and Custom Actions do not. Replacement: Plugins 
 (ChatGPT + Codex)\; GPT instructions become a skill. Source: https://hel
 p.openai.com/en/articles/20001519-custom-gpt-retirement-and-migration-fa
 q
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#chatgpt-custom-gpts
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:azure-openai-whisper-tts@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261215
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261216
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Azure OpenAI Whisper & TTS
DESCRIPTION:Azure retires version 001 of its whisper\, tts and tts-hd mod
 els on December 15. That is weeks ahead of OpenAI\, whose own API keeps 
 tts-1 until January 6\, 2027 and whisper-1 until February 26\, 2027. Mic
 rosoft's policy is to declare a replacement 90 to 120 days before retire
 ment\, yet as of October the replacement column is still a dash. The Mar
 ch 2025 gpt-4o-transcribe\, gpt-4o-mini-transcribe and gpt-4o-mini-tts s
 napshots go first\, on October 15. Replacement: None listed. Source: htt
 ps://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/concepts/model-retir
 ement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#azure-openai-whisper-tts
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
