BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tencent-qclaw@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261224
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261225
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Tencent QClaw
DESCRIPTION:Tencent's take on the OpenClaw 'lobster' agent: an AI assista
 nt driven from WeChat that operated your PC remotely\, organizing files\
 , running scheduled tasks and handling multi-step jobs. It opened to eve
 ryone on March 20\, 2026\, at the height of China's lobster craze. On Se
 ptember 24 Tencent stopped new sign-ups and renewals\, citing 'business 
 development adjustments'. Service ends at 00:00 on December 24 (Beijing 
 time)\; users can still log in to download backups until March 24\, 2027
 \, when the data is deleted. Replacement: Tencent WorkBuddy. Source: htt
 ps://technode.com/2026/09/24/tencents-qclaw-to-stop-operating-on-decembe
 r-24/
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#tencent-qclaw
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-self-serve-fine-tuning@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270106
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270107
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: OpenAI Self-Serve Fine-tuning
DESCRIPTION:OpenAI is closing self-serve fine-tuning in three steps. Sinc
 e May 7\, 2026\, organizations that had never fine-tuned can't start\; s
 ince July 2\, organizations with no fine-tuned inference in the previous
  60 days are locked out\; on January 6\, 2027\, active existing customer
 s lose the ability to create new fine-tuning jobs. Existing fine-tunes k
 eep serving until their base model retires\, and the six on legacy bases
  (ft-gpt-3.5-turbo\, ft-gpt-4\, ft-gpt-4.1-nano\, ft-o4-mini\, ft-babbag
 e-002\, ft-davinci-002) shut down October 23. Replacement: Prompt cachin
 g / system prompts. Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/depre
 cations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-self-serve-fine-tuning
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-tts-1-tts-1-hd-gpt-4o-mini-tts@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270106
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270107
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: OpenAI TTS-1\, TTS-1-HD & GPT-4o mini TTS
DESCRIPTION:On October 1 OpenAI deprecated its whole standalone text-to-s
 peech line: tts-1 and tts-1-hd\, launched at DevDay in November 2023\, a
 nd both gpt-4o-mini-tts snapshots. All four leave the API on January 6\,
  2027. There is no new TTS model\; the named replacement is the speech-t
 o-speech gpt-realtime-2.1-mini. With whisper-1 going on February 26\, 20
 27\, every audio model OpenAI shipped in 2023 is now on a removal list. 
 Replacement: gpt-realtime-2.1-mini. Source: https://developers.openai.co
 m/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-tts-1-tts-1-hd-gpt-4o-mini
 -tts
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:claude-opus-4-1-on-amazon-bedrock@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270108
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270109
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Claude Opus 4.1 on Amazon Bedrock
DESCRIPTION:Anthropic retired Opus 4.1 from its own API on August 5\, 202
 6\, but Amazon Bedrock keeps serving it until January 8\, 2027 in us-eas
 t-1\, us-east-2 and us-west-2\, 156 days longer. AWS marked it Legacy on
  July 8: no new customers\, and existing ones may lose access after 15 d
 ays of inactivity. From October 8 it is in 'public extended access'\, wh
 ere the provider can raise the price. Replacement: None named by AWS (An
 thropic recommends claude-opus-4-8). Source: https://docs.aws.amazon.com
 /bedrock/latest/userguide/model-lifecycle-legacy.html
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#claude-opus-4-1-on-amazon-bedrock
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-realtime-audio-model-family@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270121
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: OpenAI Realtime & Audio Model Family
DESCRIPTION:OpenAI put its entire GA voice stack on death row: gpt-realti
 me\, gpt-audio\, gpt-realtime-mini\, gpt-audio-mini and all four gpt-4o 
 audio/realtime variants. gpt-realtime and gpt-audio went GA in August 20
 25\, so the models that headlined 'production-ready voice agents' get ro
 ughly 17 months. OpenAI is skipping its own intermediate generation: the
  1.5 series shipped in February 2026 and the named replacement is alread
 y 2.1. Replacement: gpt-realtime-2.1 / gpt-realtime-2.1-mini / gpt-audio
 -1.5. Source: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-realtime-audio-model-famil
 y
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-whisper-1-gpt-4o-transcribe@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270226
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270227
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: OpenAI Whisper-1 & GPT-4o Transcribe
DESCRIPTION:On August 26 OpenAI deprecated whisper-1 (its original speech
 -to-text API from March 2023) together with gpt-4o-transcribe\, gpt-4o-m
 ini-transcribe and gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize\, the last of which shipped
  in October 2025. All four die February 26\, 2027. The open-source Whisp
 er weights are unaffected\; the hosted endpoint that made them a product
  is not. Replacement: gpt-transcribe / gpt-live-transcribe. Source: http
 s://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations#2026-08-26-transcription
 -models
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-whisper-1-gpt-4o-transcrib
 e
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:google-gemini-2-5-flash-image-nano-banana@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270315
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270316
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Google Gemini 2.5 Flash Image ("Nano Banana")
DESCRIPTION:The image model that went viral as 'Nano Banana' (3D figurine
  selfies\, a #1 App Store spot for Gemini) got a stay of execution. Goog
 le's earliest shutdown date was October 2\, 2026\; a September 14 releas
 e note pushed it to no earlier than March 15\, 2027\, with gemini-3.1-fl
 ash-lite-image as the replacement. Since September 18 the Gemini API ser
 ves 2.5 models only to projects that used them before\, though Google sa
 ys they 'will continue to be served until further notice.' Replacement: 
 gemini-3.1-flash-lite-image. Source: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/do
 cs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#google-gemini-2-5-flash-image-nan
 o-banana
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:firebase-studio@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270322
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270323
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Firebase Studio
DESCRIPTION:Google's browser-based\, Gemini-powered app builder absorbed 
 Project IDX at its April 2025 launch and is being sunset before its seco
 nd birthday. New workspaces and sign-ups were switched off on June 22\, 
 2026. On March 22\, 2027 the service shuts down and remaining data is 'p
 ermanently deleted and cannot be recovered.' Users are split between Goo
 gle Antigravity for coding and Google AI Studio for prompt-to-app protot
 yping\; Firestore\, Auth and App Hosting are unaffected. Replacement: Go
 ogle Antigravity / Google AI Studio. Source: https://firebase.google.com
 /docs/studio/migrating-project
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#firebase-studio
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pipedream-workflows-string@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270331
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270401
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Pipedream Workflows & String
DESCRIPTION:Pipedream will shut down Workflows\, its developer automation
  platform\, and String\, its prompt-to-agent builder\, on March 31\, 202
 7. All Workflows data\, including stored credentials and OAuth tokens\, 
 is deleted by April 30. Workflows is already in maintenance mode\, with 
 sign-ups closed. The stated reason is a focus on 'being the integration 
 layer companies rely on to connect AI to the outside world'\, and Pipedr
 eam Connect\, with its API and MCP servers\, carries on. Workday agreed 
 to buy the company in November 2025. Replacement: None (Pipedream Connec
 t continues\; JSON export for workflows). Source: https://pipedream.com/
 docs/workflows
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#pipedream-workflows-string
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:microsoft-foundry-agent-service-classic@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270331
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270401
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Microsoft Foundry Agent Service (classic)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft's managed agent service entered preview in December
  2024 as Azure AI Agent Service and went GA in May 2025. In March 2026 i
 t was renamed 'classic' and deprecated\, through a notice added to the d
 ocs without a formal announcement. It retires March 31\, 2027. Its threa
 ds-and-runs design was modelled on OpenAI's Assistants API\, which died 
 in August 2026. Migrating means rebuilding on the Responses API. Replace
 ment: New Foundry Agent Service (Responses API: threads become conversat
 ions\, runs become responses). Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us
 /azure/foundry-classic/agents/whats-new
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#microsoft-foundry-agent-service-c
 lassic
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:openai-gpt-5-3-codex-gpt-5-1-gpt-5-4-nano@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270401
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270402
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: OpenAI GPT-5.3-Codex\, GPT-5.1 & GPT-5.4-nano
DESCRIPTION:On October 1 OpenAI deprecated gpt-5.3-codex\, gpt-5.1 and gp
 t-5.4-nano\, with removal from the API on April 1\, 2027. gpt-6-sol repl
 aces the first two and gpt-6-luna the third\; both shipped nine days bef
 ore the notice. gpt-5.4-nano launched March 17\, 2026 and gets just over
  a year\, although in April OpenAI was recommending it as the replacemen
 t for GPT-3.5 Turbo and the o-series. GitHub made GPT-5.3-Codex Copilot'
 s first long-term-support model\, promised through February 4\, 2027. Re
 placement: gpt-6-sol / gpt-6-luna. Source: https://developers.openai.com
 /api/docs/deprecations
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#openai-gpt-5-3-codex-gpt-5-1-gpt-
 5-4-nano
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:vertex-ai-legacy-embedding-models@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270401
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270402
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Vertex AI Legacy Embedding Models
DESCRIPTION:Four pre-Gemini embedding models retire from Vertex AI on Apr
 il 1\, 2027: multimodalembedding@001 (February 2024)\, text-embedding-00
 4 and text-multilingual-embedding-002 (May 2024)\, and text-embedding-00
 5 (November 2024). Google names no replacement. Vectors from different e
 mbedding models are not interchangeable\, so every index built on these 
 models has to be regenerated\, not just pointed at a new model. text-emb
 edding-004 already left the Gemini Developer API on January 14\, 2026. R
 eplacement: None named\; gemini-embedding-001 / gemini-embedding-2. Sour
 ce: https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/model
 s/model-versions
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#vertex-ai-legacy-embedding-models
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:azure-openai-gpt-4-1-4-1-mini@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270414
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270415
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Azure OpenAI GPT-4.1 & 4.1 mini
DESCRIPTION:GPT-4.1 launched April 2025 as OpenAI's 'best model for codin
 g' with a 1M-token context window. Azure first scheduled it and gpt-4.1-
 mini to retire on October 14\, 2026\, then moved both back six months to
  April 14\, 2027\, in the Deprecated stage (existing customers only). gp
 t-4o 2024-08-06 and gpt-4o-mini 2024-07-18 retire the same day. Fine-tun
 ed 4.1 and 4.1-mini deployments run until October 14\, 2027. Replacement
 : None listed. Source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/o
 penai/concepts/model-retirement-schedule
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#azure-openai-gpt-4-1-4-1-mini
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:amazon-q-developer-ide-plugins-subscriptions@killedbyai.net
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270430
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270501
SUMMARY:🪦 Shutdown: Amazon Q Developer (IDE plugins & subscriptions)
DESCRIPTION:On April 30\, 2027\, three years to the day after general ava
 ilability\, AWS ends support for the Amazon Q Developer IDE plugins for 
 VS Code\, JetBrains\, Eclipse and Visual Studio. Paid subscriptions and 
 the Java and .NET code-transformation tools end the same day. New sign-u
 ps stopped on May 15\, 2026\, and the newest coding models\, including O
 pus 4.7\, were made Kiro-only. Q Developer survives in the AWS Console\,
  the mobile app\, and Slack and Teams. Replacement: Kiro. Source: https:
 //aws.amazon.com/blogs/devops/amazon-q-developer-end-of-support-announce
 ment/
URL:https://killedbyai.net/coming-soon/#amazon-q-developer-ide-plugins-su
 bscriptions
CATEGORIES:AI shutdown
